When using IcebergSource#getTable(), path is the key to identify table in Iceberg in findTable(). Currently, the table is identified based on whether "path" contains "/", as:
if (path.contains("/")) {
  // hadoop table
} else {
  // hive table
}

When using source like ”parquet", I could specify "path" as "test", and it is treated as a relative path to working directory. But when trying to specify "path" as "test" against Iceberg, it might cause ambiguity. Current logic treats it as a hive table, but actually I would like to have a hadoop table (with a relative path)
